  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "651f14a10894afa9",
      "translationZh": "今天，我们推出 smolagents，这是一个非常简单的库，能让语言模型具备智能体能力。先来一睹为快：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a9360e0212a4d173",
      "translationZh": "目录",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "53f23fb1f583c51b",
      "translationZh": "🤔 什么是智能体？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "eb7ebbb09229862d",
      "translationZh": "✅ 何时使用智能体 / ⛔ 何时避免使用智能体",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "af4a436db6458457",
      "translationZh": "代码智能体",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c1fff04500dd9a89",
      "translationZh": "介绍 smolagents：让智能体变得简单 🥳",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "377f287156da70ed",
      "translationZh": "构建智能体",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1341c8a2e077b2dd",
      "translationZh": "开放模型在智能体工作流中的能力有多强？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ce75da2a9ff3d47c",
      "translationZh": "后续步骤 🚀",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "53f23fb1f583c51b",
      "translationZh": "🤔 什么是智能体？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1709018ae03978f1",
      "translationZh": "任何使用 AI 的高效系统都需要为 LLMs 提供某种访问现实世界的途径：例如，能够调用搜索工具来获取外部信息，或操作某些程序以解决任务。换句话说，LLMs 应当具备自主行动能力。智能体程序是 LLMs 通往外部世界的门户。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0822aa990f9ec877",
      "translationZh": "AI 智能体是由 LLM 输出控制工作流的程序。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e52e57155d5d9144",
      "translationZh": "任何利用 LLMs 的系统都会将 LLM 输出集成到代码中。LLM 的输入对代码工作流的影响程度，就是 LLMs 在该系统中的自主行动能力水平。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "892deff535611519",
      "translationZh": "请注意，根据这一定义，“智能体”并不是一个非 0 即 1 的离散定义：相反，随着你赋予 LLM 对工作流更多或更少的控制权，“自主行动能力”会在一个连续谱上变化。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e3ba951c5903c162",
      "translationZh": "下表展示了不同系统的自主行动能力如何变化：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8f847168285f70a7",
      "translationZh": "自主行动能力水平",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "526e0087cc3f254d",
      "translationZh": "描述",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ad7db2e4b5671f10",
      "translationZh": "这叫什么",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2c959f5946547ada",
      "translationZh": "示例模式",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "63255cf79d3acd3d",
      "translationZh": "LLM 输出不影响程序流程",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f906d578f61ff277",
      "translationZh": "简单处理器",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "873771e19d4db4b5",
      "translationZh": "LLM 输出决定基本控制流",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "065d8e6c0bf74a69",
      "translationZh": "路由器",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fa396ce20fa81ee9",
      "translationZh": "LLM 输出决定函数的执行",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "17011048725fe0aa",
      "translationZh": "工具调用",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "73e0276700a35f81",
      "translationZh": "LLM 输出控制迭代以及程序是否继续运行",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dd5e70d0718b3198",
      "translationZh": "多步骤智能体",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "14a437949aea76f6",
      "translationZh": "当 llm_should_continue() 为真时，执行 execute_next_step()，并重复此过程。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ded99f2fc773a1ea",
      "translationZh": "一个智能体工作流可以启动另一个智能体工作流",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "70a47f8d21a9f633",
      "translationZh": "多智能体",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5385439269205a9e",
      "translationZh": "多步智能体的代码结构如下：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2b37967901f5465c",
      "translationZh": "因此，这个系统会循环运行，在每一步执行一个新的动作（动作可以涉及调用一些预先确定的工具，这些工具其实就是函数），直到它的观察结果明确表明，已经达到能够解决给定任务的满意状态。下面是一个多步智能体如何解决简单数学问题的示例：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "eb7ebbb09229862d",
      "translationZh": "✅ 何时使用智能体 / ⛔ 何时避免使用智能体",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "23ebf69519b26595",
      "translationZh": "当你需要让大语言模型来决定应用的工作流时，智能体就很有用。但它们往往有些大材小用。问题在于：为了高效解决手头的任务，我真的需要工作流具备灵活性吗？如果预先确定的工作流经常无法满足需求，那就意味着你需要更高的灵活性。举个例子：假设你正在开发一个应用，用于处理冲浪旅行网站上的客户请求。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "35d4f52b502aa1e9",
      "translationZh": "你可能事先就知道，这些请求会归入 2 个类别中的一个（根据用户的选择），而且你已经为这 2 种情况分别预定义了工作流。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7716b8d5c47a5c06",
      "translationZh": "想了解一些旅行相关信息？⇒ 为他们提供一个搜索栏，让他们搜索你的知识库",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "42f4e5ae4c937995",
      "translationZh": "想和销售人员聊聊？⇒ 让他们填写联系表单。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1a73e2ab3717c841",
      "translationZh": "如果这种确定性工作流适用于所有查询，那就尽管把一切都写成代码！这会给你一个 100% 可靠的系统，不会因为让不可预测的 LLM 插手工作流而引入出错风险。为了保持简单和稳健，建议尽量朝着不使用任何智能体行为的方向收敛。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1508c1eb68a0d6e5",
      "translationZh": "但如果无法提前把工作流确定得那么清楚呢？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "babd4ed8405ede51",
      "translationZh": "例如，用户想问：“我周一可以来，但我忘了带护照，所以可能会延迟到周三。能不能在周二早上带我和我的东西去冲浪，并提供取消保险？”这个问题取决于许多因素，上述预先确定的标准很可能没有一个足以应对这一请求。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4b91cb7f878fcc20",
      "translationZh": "如果预先确定的工作流经常无法满足需求，那就意味着你需要更大的灵活性。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0a9b8698ef44a4c9",
      "translationZh": "这时，采用智能体的方案就能派上用场。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "04d7fdc6421a0a05",
      "translationZh": "在上面的例子中，你可以直接构建一个多步骤智能体，让它能够访问用于获取天气预报的天气 API、用于计算行程距离的 Google Maps API、员工可用情况仪表板，以及基于你的知识库的 RAG 系统。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a6f4fd96cb7a7708",
      "translationZh": "直到不久前，计算机程序还只能执行预先确定的工作流，试图通过堆叠 if/else 分支来处理复杂性。它们专注于极其狭窄的任务，比如“计算这些数字的总和”或“找出这个图中的最短路径”。但实际上，大多数现实生活中的任务，比如上面的出行例子，都无法套入预先确定的工作流。智能体系统为程序打开了现实世界任务的广阔天地！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "af4a436db6458457",
      "translationZh": "代码智能体",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2f24ab095a2f8996",
      "translationZh": "在多步智能体中，LLM 在每一步都可以通过调用外部工具来编写一个动作。编写这些动作的一种常见格式（Anthropic、OpenAI 以及许多其他厂商都在使用），通常是以下做法的各种变体：“将动作写成一个包含工具名称和待用参数的 JSON，然后解析它，以确定要执行哪个工具以及使用哪些参数”。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2230c22e45ea3eba",
      "translationZh": "多篇研究论文表明，让负责调用工具的 LLM 用代码来表达工具调用，效果要好得多。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f111b16e1fe0b8fc",
      "translationZh": "原因很简单：我们设计编程语言，正是为了尽可能好地表达计算机执行的动作。如果 JSON 片段是更好的表达方式，那么 JSON 就会成为最主流的编程语言，而编程就会成为人间地狱。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f5585837d584106a",
      "translationZh": "下图摘自《Executable Code Actions Elicit Better LLM Agents》，展示了用代码编写动作的一些优势：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a9033a0e204fe55f",
      "translationZh": "用代码而不是类似 JSON 的片段来编写动作，在以下方面表现更好：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5b1a653aa14c6d58",
      "translationZh": "可组合性：你能把 JSON 动作相互嵌套，或者定义一组 JSON 动作供以后复用，就像直接定义一个 python 函数那样吗？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f994acb783d67cd1",
      "translationZh": "对象管理：你如何在 JSON 中存储 generate_image 这样的动作所产生的输出？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f05064e9f22055a1",
      "translationZh": "通用性：代码本就是为了简洁地表达你能让计算机做的任何事情而设计的。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0fcfeae4d89683b8",
      "translationZh": "在 LLM 训练数据中的覆盖：LLM 的训练数据中已经包含大量高质量的代码动作，这意味着它们已经接受过这方面的训练！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c1fff04500dd9a89",
      "translationZh": "介绍 smolagents：让智能体变得简单 🥳",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "de39150d3fb5595e",
      "translationZh": "我们构建 smolagents 时设定了以下目标：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7b96958281ca9513",
      "translationZh": "✨ 简单：智能体的逻辑只需约几千行代码就能实现（参见此文件）。我们在原始代码之上，仅保留了最精简的抽象！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bf683bf2f8c6adad",
      "translationZh": "🧑‍💻 为代码智能体（Code Agents）提供一等支持，即用代码编写自身动作的智能体（而不是“被用来编写代码的智能体”）。为确保安全，我们支持通过 E2B 在沙箱环境中执行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "152d6fcce63f330d",
      "translationZh": "除了这个 CodeAgent 类，我们仍然支持标准的 ToolCallingAgent，它将动作写成 JSON/文本块。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0309555022dbde38",
      "translationZh": "🤗 Hub 集成：你可以将工具分享到 Hub，也可以从 Hub 加载工具，更多功能即将推出！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4eb4e4a3c37fd051",
      "translationZh": "🌐 支持任何 LLM：它支持托管在 Hub 上、以 transformers 版本加载或通过我们的推理 API 调用的模型，也通过我们的 LiteLLM 集成支持来自 OpenAI、Anthropic 及许多其他提供商的模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6b806a6efed9bf2e",
      "translationZh": "smolagents 是 transformers.agents 的继任者，并将在 transformers.agents 未来被弃用时取代它。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "377f287156da70ed",
      "translationZh": "构建智能体",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8ddde5a47a5c79dc",
      "translationZh": "要构建智能体，你至少需要两个要素：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cb9356f2f5a22692",
      "translationZh": "tools：智能体可以使用的工具列表",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0075",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "06de0c24d62c24d7",
      "translationZh": "model：作为智能体引擎的 LLM。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a52e50bec7816939",
      "translationZh": "对于模型，你可以使用任何 LLM：既可以通过我们的 HfApiModel 类使用开放模型，该类利用了 Hugging Face 的免费推理 API（如上面的豹子示例所示）；也可以使用 LiteLLMModel 来利用 litellm，从 100+ 种不同的云端 LLM 中进行选择。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0077",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "08f54303678509ac",
      "translationZh": "对于工具，你只需创建一个函数，为输入和输出添加类型提示，并在文档字符串中描述输入，然后使用 @tool 装饰器将其变成工具。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "30069fde9f0b745f",
      "translationZh": "下面介绍如何创建一个从 Google Maps 获取出行时间的自定义工具，以及如何在旅行规划智能体中使用它：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0079",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bae5d56c2e48cd97",
      "translationZh": "经过几个收集出行时间和执行计算的步骤后，智能体给出了以下最终方案：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8006f291dbe4714a",
      "translationZh": "构建工具后，将它分享到 Hub 就这么简单：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4ba886ffb59613d7",
      "translationZh": "你可以在这个 space 中查看结果。你可以在该 space 的 tool.py 文件中查看工具的逻辑。如你所见，这个工具实际上被导出为一个继承自 Tool 类的类，而 Tool 类是我们所有工具的底层结构。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "1341c8a2e077b2dd",
      "translationZh": "开放模型在智能体工作流中有多强？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "051c506c2949a66b",
      "translationZh": "我们用一些领先模型创建了 CodeAgent 实例，并在这个基准测试中对它们进行了比较。该基准测试汇集了几个不同基准测试中的问题，以提供多样化的挑战组合。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d46bf5afb6f21d73",
      "translationZh": "在这里查看该基准测试，了解所用智能体配置的更多细节，并查看代码智能体与工具调用智能体的对比（剧透：代码表现更好）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0085",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9d7fe384b128bd63",
      "translationZh": "这项对比表明，开源模型现在已经能与最好的闭源模型一较高下！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0086",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ce75da2a9ff3d47c",
      "translationZh": "后续步骤 🚀",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0087",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "33993d3536fd643f",
      "translationZh": "从引导式导览开始，熟悉这个库。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0088",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "02e792408f07e527",
      "translationZh": "学习更深入的教程，进一步了解工具或通用最佳实践。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0089",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e5270b27b93146d8",
      "translationZh": "深入研究示例，搭建特定系统：text-to-SQL、智能体式 RAG 或多智能体编排。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0090",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "da137d1d04c90d83",
      "translationZh": "阅读更多关于智能体的内容：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0091",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "41f12e32394c80bd",
      "translationZh": "Anthropic 的这篇优秀博文提供了扎实的通用知识。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0092",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "86bec7decc460617",
      "translationZh": "这个合集汇集了最具影响力的智能体研究论文。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
